<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- Missile item / body / part info cards (MissileInfoCardUtility) -->

  <!-- Class and platforms -->
  <!-- EN: Missile body -->
  <DMSE.Card.Body>彈體</DMSE.Card.Body>
  <!-- EN: Missile item -->
  <DMSE.Card.Item>導彈物品</DMSE.Card.Item>
  <!-- EN: Size class -->
  <DMSE.Card.SizeClass>量級</DMSE.Card.SizeClass>
  <!-- EN: Loitering munition: the earliest beyond-visual-range weapon. Tilt-launched and allowed on gravships. It is slow, but its small radar signature means it is detected later. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Loitering>巡飛彈：最前期的超視距武器，傾斜發射、可上重力船。速度慢，但雷達截面小、較晚被發現。</DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Loitering>
  <!-- EN: Light missile: short- to medium-range air defense or ground attack, loaded into multi-round launchers. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Light>輕型導彈：中短程防空或對地打擊，由多聯裝發射架裝填。</DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Light>
  <!-- EN: Medium missile: cruise or anti-ballistic missions. Parts can be customized on the item or on a storage rack. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Medium>中型導彈：巡航或反彈道任務，可在物品或儲存架上自定義部件。</DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Medium>
  <!-- EN: Ballistic missile: long-range strike. Vertical launch only and cannot be built on a gravship. It is built and configured directly on the launch silo. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Ballistic>彈道導彈：長程打擊，只能垂直發射、不可建於重力船上，直接在發射井上建造與裝配。</DMSE.Card.SizeClassDesc.Ballistic>
  <!-- EN: Launch mode -->
  <DMSE.Card.LaunchMode>發射方式</DMSE.Card.LaunchMode>
  <!-- EN: Tilt launch -->
  <DMSE.Card.LaunchMode.Tilt>傾斜發射</DMSE.Card.LaunchMode.Tilt>
  <!-- EN: Vertical launch -->
  <DMSE.Card.LaunchMode.Vertical>垂直發射</DMSE.Card.LaunchMode.Vertical>
  <!-- EN: Tilt or vertical -->
  <DMSE.Card.LaunchMode.Both>傾斜或垂直</DMSE.Card.LaunchMode.Both>
  <!-- EN: Determines which launch platforms can load this missile. Tilt launchers can rotate and can be built on gravships. Vertical launchers have one facing and cannot be built on gravships. Launch mode does not change flight stats. -->
  <DMSE.Card.LaunchModeDesc>決定可裝填此彈的發射平台。傾斜發射架可旋轉、可建於重力船上；垂直發射架只有單一朝向，不可建於重力船上。發射方式不影響彈道數值。</DMSE.Card.LaunchModeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Launch platforms -->
  <DMSE.Card.Platforms>可用發射平台</DMSE.Card.Platforms>
  <!-- EN: Launch platforms that can load this missile, based on each platform's fixed storage settings. Click the links below to view them. -->
  <DMSE.Card.PlatformsDesc>可裝填這種導彈的發射平台（依各平台的固定儲存設定）。點擊下方連結查看平台。</DMSE.Card.PlatformsDesc>
  <!-- EN: Configured on -->
  <DMSE.Card.Customize>裝配位置</DMSE.Card.Customize>
  <!-- EN: Not configurable -->
  <DMSE.Card.Customize.None>不可改裝</DMSE.Card.Customize.None>
  <!-- EN: Missile item -->
  <DMSE.Card.Customize.Item>導彈物品</DMSE.Card.Customize.Item>
  <!-- EN: Storage building -->
  <DMSE.Card.Customize.StorageBuilding>儲存建築</DMSE.Card.Customize.StorageBuilding>
  <!-- EN: Launch platform -->
  <DMSE.Card.Customize.Launcher>發射平台</DMSE.Card.Customize.Launcher>
  <!-- EN: Fixed configuration. Parts cannot be changed. -->
  <DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.None>構型固定，無法更換部件。</DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.None>
  <!-- EN: Select the missile item and change parts in its Assembly tab. After you confirm, colonists bring the materials and do the work. You can also order it built to spec at a missile assembly bench. -->
  <DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.Item>選取導彈物品，在「裝配」分頁更換部件；確認後小人會搬來材料並施工。也可在導彈組裝台直接訂製。</DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.Item>
  <!-- EN: Parts are changed on a dedicated storage building, consuming resources. -->
  <DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.StorageBuilding>在專屬儲存建築上消耗資源調整部件。</DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.StorageBuilding>
  <!-- EN: No item form: choose the body and configure parts directly on the launch platform. -->
  <DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.Launcher>沒有物品型態：直接在發射平台上選擇彈體並裝配部件。</DMSE.Card.CustomizeDesc.Launcher>
  <!-- EN: Part slots -->
  <DMSE.Card.Slots>裝配槽位</DMSE.Card.Slots>
  <!-- EN: The part slots this body offers. Each slot holds at most one part. Slots the body does not have cannot be used. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SlotsDesc>此彈體開放的部件槽位。每個槽位最多裝一個部件；沒有的槽位無法裝配。</DMSE.Card.SlotsDesc>
  <!-- EN: No part is installed in this slot. -->
  <DMSE.Card.EmptySlotDesc>此槽位目前沒有部件。</DMSE.Card.EmptySlotDesc>

  <!-- Strike stats -->
  <!-- EN: Damage and damage type of the main blast at the impact point. Warhead parts can add or remove damage and override the damage type. -->
  <DMSE.Card.DamageDesc>主爆炸在落點造成的傷害量與傷害類型。彈頭部件可加減傷害並覆寫傷害類型。</DMSE.Card.DamageDesc>
  <!-- EN: Radius of the main blast, in cells. Warhead and payload effects use the payload capacity N for their own area and are not affected by this value. -->
  <DMSE.Card.RadiusDesc>主爆炸的半徑（格）。戰鬥部與酬載特效另以載荷容量 N 決定範圍，不受此值影響。</DMSE.Card.RadiusDesc>
  <!-- EN: Random offset radius of the impact point from the aim point, in cells. Guidance parts tighten it. Inertial guidance has the most scatter. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ScatterDesc>落點相對瞄準點的隨機偏移半徑（格）。導引部件可收緊散布；慣性制導最大。</DMSE.Card.ScatterDesc>
  <!-- EN: {0} tiles -->
  <DMSE.Card.RangeTiles>{0} 格</DMSE.Card.RangeTiles>
  <!-- EN: Unlimited -->
  <DMSE.Card.Unlimited>不限</DMSE.Card.Unlimited>
  <!-- EN: Maximum strike distance on the world map.\nRange = (fuel × specific impulse × conversion factor + flat bonus + warhead range) × payload factor\n\nFuel: {0}\nSpecific impulse: {1}\nConversion factor: {2}\nFlat bonus: {3}\nWarhead range: {4}\nPayload factor: {5}\n\nResult: {6} -->
  <DMSE.Card.RangeDesc>世界地圖上的最大打擊距離。\n射程 =（燃料 × 比衝 × 換算係數 + 固定加成 + 戰鬥部增程）× 酬載倍率\n\n燃料：{0}\n比衝：{1}\n換算係數：{2}\n固定加成：{3}\n戰鬥部增程：{4}\n酬載倍率：{5}\n\n結果：{6}</DMSE.Card.RangeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Flight speed multiplier on the world map. Faster missiles give enemy air defense less time to engage. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SpeedDesc>世界地圖上的飛行速度倍率。越快，敵方防空可接戰的時間越短。</DMSE.Card.SpeedDesc>
  <!-- EN: Payload capacity N -->
  <DMSE.Card.PayloadCapacity>載荷容量 N</DMSE.Card.PayloadCapacity>
  <!-- EN: Set by the body. The area, count and strength of every warhead and payload effect scale with N (for example, an incendiary warhead ignites everything within N cells), so the same part is stronger on a bigger body. -->
  <DMSE.Card.PayloadCapacityDesc>由彈體決定。所有戰鬥部與酬載特效的範圍、數量與強度都以 N 換算（例如燒夷彈頭的引燃半徑 = N 格），所以同一個部件裝在大彈體上效果更強。</DMSE.Card.PayloadCapacityDesc>
  <!-- EN: Missiles that penetrate thick roofs breach the rock before detonating, and their seekers also lock onto targets under thick roofs. Other missiles that hit a thick roof only explode on the rock surface. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ThickRoofDesc>能穿透厚岩頂者會先在岩層開孔再引爆，導引頭也會鎖定厚岩頂下的目標；不能穿透者打在厚岩頂上只在岩層表面爆炸。</DMSE.Card.ThickRoofDesc>

  <!-- Guidance -->
  <!-- EN: No guidance -->
  <DMSE.Card.NoGuidance>無導引</DMSE.Card.NoGuidance>
  <!-- EN: With terminal guidance, how many times the missile can correct its impact point to the target's new position in flight (body base count plus seeker bonus). When they run out, it flies to the last known position and misses if the target has left. -->
  <DMSE.Card.TerminalUpdatesDesc>具導引能力時，飛行中可依目標新位置修正落點的次數（彈體基礎次數加上導引頭加成）。次數用完後沿最後位置飛行，目標若已離開即落空。</DMSE.Card.TerminalUpdatesDesc>
  <!-- EN: Fire-control channels the missile occupies for the whole flight. Only radio command, fire-control radar and TV guidance need continuous ground support. Autonomous seekers and preset guidance use none. Ballistic missiles use 2 channels each, others use 1; TV guidance adds 1 more. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ChannelsDesc>導彈飛行期間持續占用的火控通道數。只有無線電指令、火控雷達與電視導引需要地面持續支援；自主尋標與預先裝定的導引不占通道。彈道導彈每枚占 2 條，其他占 1 條；電視導引再多占 1 條。</DMSE.Card.ChannelsDesc>
  <!-- EN: 1 per missile (2 ballistic, TV +1) -->
  <DMSE.Card.ChannelsPerMissile>每枚 1（彈道 2；電視導引 +1）</DMSE.Card.ChannelsPerMissile>
  <!-- EN: While loitering, the seeker searches again every {0}. Terminal defenses can still engage it during this time. -->
  <DMSE.Card.LoiterRetry>盤旋期間每 {0} 重新搜尋一次目標，期間仍會被末端防禦接戰。</DMSE.Card.LoiterRetry>
  <!-- EN: Only loitering munitions can loiter. Other bodies with this part do not. -->
  <DMSE.Card.LoiterOnlyLoitering>只有巡飛彈能使用盤旋能力；裝在其他彈體上不會盤旋。</DMSE.Card.LoiterOnlyLoitering>
  <!-- EN: No guidance part installed: uses the body's built-in targeting. -->
  <DMSE.Card.BuiltInGuidance>未裝導引部件，使用彈體內建的選目標方式。</DMSE.Card.BuiltInGuidance>
  <!-- EN: Built for moving targets on the world map: the flight path re-aims more often. -->
  <DMSE.Card.TracksMobile>針對世界地圖上的移動目標：航跡會更頻繁地重新瞄準。</DMSE.Card.TracksMobile>
  <!-- EN: Terminal guidance -->
  <DMSE.Card.TerminalGuidance>導引能力</DMSE.Card.TerminalGuidance>
  <!-- EN: Provides terminal guidance: can strike across map layers and track moving targets using the body's terminal updates. -->
  <DMSE.Card.TerminalGuidanceYes>具導引能力：可跨圖層打擊，並可依彈體的終端更新次數追蹤移動目標。</DMSE.Card.TerminalGuidanceYes>
  <!-- EN: No terminal guidance: cannot strike across map layers or track moving targets. -->
  <DMSE.Card.TerminalGuidanceNo>無導引能力：無法跨圖層打擊，也無法追蹤移動目標。</DMSE.Card.TerminalGuidanceNo>
  <!-- EN: Impact point -->
  <DMSE.Card.TargetSelection>選定落點</DMSE.Card.TargetSelection>
  <!-- EN: Chosen by player -->
  <DMSE.Card.TargetManual>由玩家選擇</DMSE.Card.TargetManual>
  <!-- EN: Automatic lock -->
  <DMSE.Card.TargetAuto>自動鎖定</DMSE.Card.TargetAuto>
  <!-- EN: A salvo of missiles with the same seeker type spreads its locks over different targets instead of all hitting the same one. -->
  <DMSE.Card.SpreadNote>同類導引頭的齊射會分散鎖定不同目標，不會全部打在同一處。</DMSE.Card.SpreadNote>

  <!-- Air defense and survivability -->
  <!-- EN: Intercept hit factor -->
  <DMSE.Card.Intercept>攔截命中係數</DMSE.Card.Intercept>
  <!-- EN: When fired as an interceptor, this multiplies the hit chance computed by the fire-control radar (on both the map and the world map). -->
  <DMSE.Card.InterceptDesc>作為攔截彈發射時，乘在火控雷達算出的命中率上（地圖層與世界層皆同）。</DMSE.Card.InterceptDesc>
  <!-- EN: Warhead bonus: hit chance +{0} -->
  <DMSE.Card.InterceptBonus>戰鬥部加成：命中率 +{0}</DMSE.Card.InterceptBonus>
  <!-- EN: Extra intercept rolls: {0} (can hit other targets in the same wave) -->
  <DMSE.Card.InterceptRolls>額外攔截判定：{0} 次（可波及同波次其他目標）</DMSE.Card.InterceptRolls>
  <!-- EN: Multiplies the detection range level of the world-map track. Above 1, the missile is detected earlier and draws air defenses that use threat assessment (a decoy). Below 1, it is detected later (penetration). -->
  <DMSE.Card.SignatureDesc>乘在世界航跡的偵測距離等級上。大於 1 會更早被發現，可吸引具威脅評估的防空優先接戰（誘餌）；小於 1 會更晚被發現（突防）。</DMSE.Card.SignatureDesc>
  <!-- EN: Chaff charges and jamming strength. On the world map, a charge is used whenever enemy fire control locks on, with a {0} chance to break the lock and delay the next one. Charges are not replenished in flight. When intercepted on a map, the enemy hit chance is reduced by {1}. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ChaffDesc>攜帶的箔條／干擾絲次數與干擾強度。世界地圖上被敵方火控鎖定時觸發，每次消耗一發，有 {0} 機率斷鎖並延後重新鎖定；飛行中不補充。在地圖上被攔截時，敵方命中率降低 {1}。</DMSE.Card.ChaffDesc>

  <!-- Effects -->
  <!-- EN: Warhead effect -->
  <DMSE.Card.WarheadEffect>戰鬥部效果</DMSE.Card.WarheadEffect>
  <!-- EN: Payload effect -->
  <DMSE.Card.PayloadEffect>酬載效果</DMSE.Card.PayloadEffect>
  <!-- EN: Values above are for payload capacity N = {0}. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ScaledByN>以上數值依載荷容量 N = {0} 計算。</DMSE.Card.ScaledByN>
  <!-- EN: The effect scales with the body's payload capacity N: -->
  <DMSE.Card.ScaledByNGroups>效果依彈體的載荷容量 N 換算：</DMSE.Card.ScaledByNGroups>
  <!-- EN: N = {0} ({1}) -->
  <DMSE.Card.NGroup>N = {0}（{1}）</DMSE.Card.NGroup>
  <!-- EN: When used as an interceptor, hit chance +{0} (N × 5%). No extra effect against ground targets. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.ContinuousRod>作為攔截彈時命中率 +{0}（N × 5%）。對地沒有額外效果。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.ContinuousRod>
  <!-- EN: Range +{0} tiles (N × 2). No extra effect at the impact point. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.ExtendedFuel>射程 +{0} 格（N × 2）。落點沒有額外效果。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.ExtendedFuel>
  <!-- EN: Against ground targets: an extra blast with radius {0} and {1} damage at the impact point. As an interceptor: {2} extra independent intercept rolls (N ÷ 5, rounded down) that can hit other targets in the same wave. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.Airburst>對地：在落點追加半徑 {0}、{1} 點的爆炸。作為攔截彈：額外 {2} 次獨立攔截判定（N ÷ 5 取整），可波及同波次其他目標。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.Airburst>
  <!-- EN: Penetrates thick roofs and locks onto targets under them. After the main blast, an extra blast with radius 2 and {0} damage hits the impact point. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.TungstenPenetrator>可穿透厚岩頂，並鎖定厚岩頂下的目標；主爆炸後在落點追加半徑 2、{0} 點的爆炸。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.TungstenPenetrator>
  <!-- EN: Ignores line of sight and sets fires within {0} cells of the impact point. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.Incendiary>無視視線，引燃落點半徑 {0} 格內的地面。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.Incendiary>
  <!-- EN: Ignores line of sight. An EMP blast with radius {0} and {1} damage disables electronics and mechanoids. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.EMP>無視視線，在落點引發半徑 {0}、{1} 點的 EMP 爆炸：癱瘓電子設備與機械體。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.EMP>
  <!-- EN: Every animal on the target map immediately goes berserk. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.AnimalBerserk>目標地圖上所有動物立即陷入狂暴。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.AnimalBerserk>
  <!-- EN: Releases {0} physical bomblets ({1}) that land within {2} cells. The bomblets fly and can hit anyone in their path. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.ClusterBomblets>撒出 {0} 枚實體子彈（{1}），落在半徑 {2} 格內；子彈會飛行並命中沿途的單位。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.ClusterBomblets>
  <!-- EN: When fired by the player, each pawn of a non-hostile faction in the spread area costs {0} goodwill with that faction. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.ClusterGoodwill>玩家發射時，撒布範圍內每有一個非敵對勢力的單位，該勢力好感 -{0}。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.ClusterGoodwill>
  <!-- EN: Every creature within radius {0} takes {1} burn damage, and each cell has a {2} chance to catch fire. Most effective in enclosed rooms. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.Thermobaric>半徑 {0} 內每個生物受到 {1} 點燒傷，每格有 {2} 機率起火；在密閉房間內效果最明顯。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.Thermobaric>
  <!-- EN: Almost no blast: strikes the nearest creature within 3 cells of the impact point with {0} blades, each dealing {1} cut damage. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Warhead.KineticBlades>幾乎沒有爆炸：對落點 3 格內最近的一個生物揮出 {0} 片刀刃，每片 {1} 點切割傷害。</DMSE.Card.Warhead.KineticBlades>
  <!-- EN: An extra blast with radius {0} and {1} damage at the impact point. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.HighExplosive>在落點追加半徑 {0}、{1} 點的爆炸。</DMSE.Card.Payload.HighExplosive>
  <!-- EN: Penetrates thick roofs and locks onto targets under them. Detonates inside with radius {0} and {1} damage ({2} armor penetration), and deals an extra {4} structural damage to buildings within {3} cells of the center. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.BunkerBuster>可穿透厚岩頂，並鎖定厚岩頂下的目標。在內部以半徑 {0}、{1} 點（穿甲 {2}）引爆，並對爆心 {3} 格內的建築額外造成 {4} 點結構傷害。</DMSE.Card.Payload.BunkerBuster>
  <!-- EN: Scatters {1} sub-explosions within {0} cells, each with radius {2} and {3} damage. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.Cluster>在半徑 {0} 格內散落 {1} 個子爆炸，每個半徑 {2}、{3} 點。</DMSE.Card.Payload.Cluster>
  <!-- EN: Each plant within {0} cells has a {1} chance to die. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.Defoliant>半徑 {0} 格內的植物各有 {1} 機率枯死。</DMSE.Card.Payload.Defoliant>
  <!-- EN: Puts out fires within {0} cells and covers the area in firefoam. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.FireFoam>撲滅半徑 {0} 格內的火焰，並鋪上消防泡沫。</DMSE.Card.Payload.FireFoam>
  <!-- EN: A vaporizing blast with radius {0} and {1} damage at the impact point. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.Antiparticle>在落點引發半徑 {0}、{1} 點的汽化爆炸。</DMSE.Card.Payload.Antiparticle>
  <!-- EN: Floods every cell within {0} cells with toxic gas. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.ToxicGas>在半徑 {0} 格內灌滿毒氣。</DMSE.Card.Payload.ToxicGas>
  <!-- EN: An EMP blast with radius {0} and {1} damage at the impact point: disables electronics and stuns mechanoids. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.EMP>在落點引發半徑 {0}、{1} 點的 EMP 爆炸：癱瘓電子設備、震暈機械體。</DMSE.Card.Payload.EMP>
  <!-- EN: Range becomes {0}. Every creature within radius {1} takes (body size rounded up + 1) hits of {2} stab damage ({3} armor penetration). -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.AirburstTungsten>射程變為 {0}。半徑 {1} 內每個生物受到（體型取整 + 1）次 {2} 點穿刺傷害（穿甲 {3}）。</DMSE.Card.Payload.AirburstTungsten>
  <!-- EN: An extra blast with radius {0} and {1} damage ({2}). -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.Extra>追加半徑 {0}、{1} 點的爆炸（{2}）。</DMSE.Card.Payload.Extra>
  <!-- EN: Drops {0} × {1} ({2} chance). -->
  <DMSE.Card.Payload.Spawn>投放 {0} 份{1}（機率 {2}）。</DMSE.Card.Payload.Spawn>

  <!-- Seeker mechanics -->
  <!-- EN: Does not search for targets: impacts scatter randomly around the center of the target map and never lock onto buildings or creatures. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.Inertial>不搜尋目標：落點以地圖中心為準，依散布隨機偏移，不鎖定建築或生物。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.Inertial>
  <!-- EN: Locks onto the active enemy radar with the highest power level (ties go to the one drawing more power). Purely passive warning equipment is ignored. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiRadiation>鎖定開機中功率等級最高的敵方雷達（同級時比耗電量）；純被動預警設備不受影響。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiRadiation>
  <!-- EN: With no active radar, it targets the powered enemy building drawing the most electricity, then falls back to inertial guidance. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiRadiationFallback>沒有開機雷達時改打耗電最大的運作中敵方建築，再找不到則退回慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiRadiationFallback>
  <!-- EN: With no active radar, it does not pick another target. With loitering flight control it can wait overhead until a radar switches on. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiRadiationNoFallback>沒有開機雷達時不改打其他目標；搭配盤旋飛控可在上空等待雷達開機。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiRadiationNoFallback>
  <!-- EN: Locks onto the hottest indoor room at least {0} warmer than outdoors. Otherwise it targets the largest creature (wild animals included, the attacker and its allies excluded). If there is neither, it falls back to inertial guidance. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.HeatSource>鎖定比室外熱 {0} 以上的最熱室內房間；沒有時改打體型最大的生物（包含野生動物，但不含攻擊方與其盟友）。都沒有則退回慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.HeatSource>
  <!-- EN: Locks onto the powered enemy building drawing the most electricity. Falls back to inertial guidance if nothing is powered. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.ElectromagneticSignal>鎖定耗電最大的運作中敵方建築；沒有通電建築時退回慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.ElectromagneticSignal>
  <!-- EN: When you launch it, the game pauses on arrival and you choose the impact point freely. Enemy launches have no operator and use inertial guidance instead. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.TV>玩家發射時，抵達目標地圖後暫停遊戲，由你自由選擇落點。敵方發射時無人操作，改用慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.TV>
  <!-- EN: Locks onto the most recent laser designation your side placed on the target map. Falls back to inertial guidance if there is none. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.Laser>鎖定你在目標地圖上最近一次放置的雷射標定點；沒有標定點時退回慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.Laser>
  <!-- EN: Mainly for air-defense interception, guided by fire-control radar illumination. Against ground targets it aims inertially. Occupies a fire-control channel for the whole flight. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.FireControl>主要供防空攔截使用，由火控雷達照射引導。對地打擊時以慣性選點。飛行期間持續占用火控通道。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.FireControl>
  <!-- EN: The ground station sends continuous corrections. Against ground targets it aims inertially. Occupies a fire-control channel for the whole flight. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.RadioCommand>由地面持續發送修正指令。對地打擊時以慣性選點。飛行期間持續占用火控通道。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.RadioCommand>
  <!-- EN: Locks only onto enemy creatures in the open (not under a roof), preferring higher combat power, then larger body size. Falls back to inertial guidance if none are found. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.Imaging>只鎖定露天（無屋頂）的敵方生物，先比戰力、再比體型；找不到時退回慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.Imaging>
  <!-- EN: Fire-and-forget: locks onto the largest enemy building, then the largest enemy creature. Falls back to inertial guidance if there are neither. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.ActiveRadar>射後不理：鎖定占地最大的敵方建築，其次是體型最大的敵方生物；都沒有則退回慣性落點。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.ActiveRadar>
  <!-- EN: Built for moving targets on the world map (ships, mobile bases): the flight path corrects more often, with {0} extra terminal updates. On arrival it hits the toughest enemy building first, then the largest enemy creature. -->
  <DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiShip>針對世界地圖上的移動目標（艦船、移動基地）：航跡更頻繁地修正，終端更新 +{0}。抵達後先打最耐打的敵方建築，其次是體型最大的敵方生物。</DMSE.Card.Guidance.AntiShip>

