  <!-- EN: Part slot -->
  <DMSE.Card.PartSlot>裝配槽位</DMSE.Card.PartSlot>
  <!-- EN: The slot this part goes into. Each slot holds one part, and installing this replaces the current one. -->
  <DMSE.Card.PartSlotDesc>此部件裝在哪個槽位。同一槽位只能裝一個部件，換上會取代原有部件。</DMSE.Card.PartSlotDesc>
  <!-- EN: Compatible bodies -->
  <DMSE.Card.CompatibleBodies>適用彈體</DMSE.Card.CompatibleBodies>
  <!-- EN: Missile bodies that can take this part (they must have the matching slot). Click the links below to view them. -->
  <DMSE.Card.CompatibleBodiesDesc>可以裝配此部件的彈體（必須具有對應槽位）。點擊下方連結查看彈體。</DMSE.Card.CompatibleBodiesDesc>
  <!-- EN: Loitering munitions only. -->
  <DMSE.Card.RequiresLoitering>只能裝在巡飛彈上。</DMSE.Card.RequiresLoitering>
  <!-- EN: Research required -->
  <DMSE.Card.Research>需要研究</DMSE.Card.Research>
  <!-- EN: Can be selected once these research projects are finished. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ResearchDesc>完成這些研究後才能選用。</DMSE.Card.ResearchDesc>
