  <DMSE.Card.Cost>裝配材料</DMSE.Card.Cost>
  <!-- EN: Materials that must be hauled in and consumed to install this part during a refit. A body's default parts are already included in its build cost. When the part is removed or replaced, part of the materials is refunded according to the body's refund rate. -->
  <DMSE.Card.CostDesc>改裝時裝上此部件所需搬運並消耗的材料。彈體的預設部件已包含在建造成本中。移除或更換時，依彈體的退還比例退回部分材料。</DMSE.Card.CostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Added to the body's base value. -->
  <DMSE.Card.ModifierDesc>加算在彈體的基礎值上。</DMSE.Card.ModifierDesc>
  <!-- EN: Overrides the damage type of the main blast. -->
  <DMSE.Card.DamageTypeDesc>覆寫主爆炸的傷害類型。</DMSE.Card.DamageTypeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Fuel -->
  <DMSE.Card.Fuel>燃料</DMSE.Card.Fuel>
  <!-- EN: Specific impulse -->
  <DMSE.Card.Impulse>比衝</DMSE.Card.Impulse>
  <!-- EN: Range is roughly fuel × specific impulse × the body's conversion factor, so both increase range. -->
  <DMSE.Card.FuelImpulseDesc>射程約為 燃料 × 比衝 × 彈體換算係數，兩者都會放大射程。</DMSE.Card.FuelImpulseDesc>

