  <DMSE.Card.Refund>拆除退還</DMSE.Card.Refund>
  <!-- EN: Share of a part's materials returned when it is removed or replaced. -->
  <DMSE.Card.RefundDesc>移除或更換部件時，退還該部件材料的比例。</DMSE.Card.RefundDesc>
